<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Less we would argue, Lord, and go our way;</l><l>More we would say “Amen” to what You say.</l><l>Grant us a walk to You conformed,</l><l>’Til our living is transformed.</l><l>We adore You, Jesus—</l><l>May a pure love for You seize us.</l><l>Any unwillingness, Lord, quickly slay;</l><l>Even by faith we open all the way—</l><l>Rising to heights of love unknown,</l><l>Christ our destiny alone,</l><l>We would love You, Jesus, more!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
